{"unit_id":"duyefeng__dsh-browser#feature-1","repo":"duyefeng/dsh-browser","commit":"a87301955413f533cc606bcc76b65ccde5f0bf57","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser 的功能「navigate」：导航网页并返回最终地址与标题。通过 browser_navigate 提交网址或主机名；若输入主机名，会补上 https://，工具返回加载后的 URL 和页面标题。","source":"generated","evidence":["tool.js:46-68","index.js:66-75"]}
{"unit_id":"duyefeng__dsh-browser#feature-2","repo":"duyefeng/dsh-browser","commit":"a87301955413f533cc606bcc76b65ccde5f0bf57","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser 的功能「snapshot」：读取当前页面的 URL、标题、正文文本及带建议 CSS 选择器的交互元素列表；调用 browser_snapshot 可查看页面内容，结果会限制文本和元素数量。","source":"generated","evidence":["tool.js:70-120","index.js:78-113"]}
{"unit_id":"duyefeng__dsh-browser#feature-3","repo":"duyefeng/dsh-browser","commit":"a87301955413f533cc606bcc76b65ccde5f0bf57","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser 的功能「interact」：使用 browser_click 点击匹配选择器的首个元素，并用 browser_type 将文本填入匹配的输入控件。两项工具都针对当前页面操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["tool.js:122-157","index.js:116-134"]}
{"unit_id":"duyefeng__dsh-browser#feature-4","repo":"duyefeng/dsh-browser","commit":"a87301955413f533cc606bcc76b65ccde5f0bf57","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser 的功能「keyboard」：browser_press 可向当前页面发送指定键盘按键，例如 Enter、Tab 或 Escape，用于触发页面键盘交互。","source":"generated","evidence":["tool.js:159-175","index.js:136-144"]}
